---
source: crates/vitrify-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "long_help(&cmd, &path)"
---
Print the one-line progress summary

Usage: vitrify ledger progress [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --sdd <ROOT>
          SDD root: a bundle directory, its sdd.md, or a single *.sdd.md (default: the one SDD in the repository)

      --all
          Every SDD of the repository

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Reads:   unit front matter
Writes:  nothing
Prints:  Progress: <V>/<total> Verified · <n> <Status> · … (Retired not in the total);
         with --all one line per SDD, prefixed with its slug
Exit status: 0 printed · 4 no SDD, or several and no --sdd · 2 usage error
Examples:
  vitrify ledger progress --sdd specs/calc
  vitrify ledger progress --all
